==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Neko-Musume (Enemy)|Neko-Musume]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Even though this is the final stage and the enemies are somewhat buffed, the stage is still pretty easy to beat.

==Trivia==
*[[:w:c:gegegenokitaro:Nezumi-Otoko|Nezumi-Otoko]] is a major recurring character in ''GeGeGe no Kitarō''.

